# FileConverter F5 hydrate + dismiss UX

Evidence: BUG-2026-07-12-result-card-dismiss (S009).

When editing `FileConverter` work-session sync or dismiss controls:

1. **`handleClear` must reset all converter output state** — include `convertedFiles` and
   `conversionLog`, not only queue/manual input.
2. **Hydrate from `loadedWorkSession` only on session id change** — use a ref
   (`hydratedWorkSessionIdRef`); do not re-run full hydrate on every autosave /
   `onSessionUpdated` refresh or Remove/Clear will be undone.
3. **Autosave deps must mirror dismiss state** — include `convertedFiles` and
   `conversionLog` in debounced save triggers so Clear/Remove persist to F5 draft.
4. **Regression tests** — add or extend Vitest repro when changing hydrate or Clear:
   - Clear dismisses results card
   - Stale `loadedWorkSession` prop update after Remove must not restore card

See `apps/frontend/src/test/bug-2026-07-12-result-card-dismiss.test.tsx`.
